     <td style="border-top:0.5pt solid;padding-top:0in;border-right:0.5pt solid;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;border-bottom:0.5pt solid;text-indent:5.05pt;border-left:0.5pt solid;padding-right:0in;"><p style="margin-left:0.933%;text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-right:0.935%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Important Notice Regarding the Availability of Proxy Materials for the Annual Meeting of Stockholders to Be Held on June 9, 2026 at 9:00 a.m. Pacific time held virtually at www.virtualshareholdermeeting.com/ATRA2026. The Proxy Statement and Atara&#8217;s Annual Report on Form 10-K for the fiscal year 2025 are available electronically at </span><span style="color:#0000ff;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">www.proxyvote.com</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">.</span></p></td>
